// BESSER's limit (besser/instances/limit.py) in the Exam DSL: 4-semester with no weights.
// 8-limit.exam solved by QAOA instead: keep the two files' problems identical.
// Six exams of a semester, three batches. Feasible: cost 0.
problem limit_qaoa batches 3
students Ana Rui Eva Ivo Lia Tom
exam Algebra     { Ana Rui }
exam Calculus    { Rui Eva Tom }
exam Physics     { Ana Eva }
exam Chemistry   { Ivo Lia }
exam Programming { Lia Tom }
exam Databases   { Ivo Ana }

solver { method QAOA depth 2 optimizer COBYLA iterations 150 shots 4096 seed 7 }
